<aside class="community-session" data-community-session aria-label="전시관 참여 계정">
  <p data-community-session-note role="status">작품을 체험하고 좋아요와 댓글로 이야기를 나눠 보세요.</p>
  <div><span class="community-account" data-community-account hidden></span><button type="button" data-community-login>Google 계정으로 로그인</button><button type="button" data-community-logout hidden>로그아웃</button></div>
</aside>
<dialog class="community-login-dialog" data-community-login-dialog aria-labelledby="community-login-title">
